<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Interactive chronology · {{ project_name|e }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Source-backed Starsilk chronology with explicit unknown temporal and status fields.">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url|e }}"><link rel="alternate" type="application/json" href="chronology.json"><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="chronology.md"><link rel="stylesheet" href="chronology.css">
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#events">Skip to events</a>
<header class="chronology-bar"><a href="../">Starsilk Compendium</a><nav aria-label="Chronology destinations"><a href="../entities/chronology/">Chronology source record</a><a href="chronology.json">JSON</a><a href="chronology.md">Markdown</a><a href="AUTHORITY.md">Authority</a></nav></header>
<main id="main"><header class="chronology-head"><p class="eyebrow">Source-backed chronology explorer</p><h1>Interactive chronology</h1><p>Only direct authored chronology labels and markers appear here. No universal calendar is invented. Canon status and spoiler level are independent unknowns unless structured authority says otherwise.</p></header>
<form id="chronologyFilters" aria-label="Chronology filters"><fieldset><legend>Current view filters</legend><label>Visibility <select id="visibilityFilter" name="visibility"><option value="all">All</option><option value="public">Public</option><option value="unknown">Unknown</option></select></label><label>Canon status <select id="canonFilter" name="canon"><option value="all">All</option><option value="unknown">Unknown</option></select></label><label>Spoiler level <select id="spoilerFilter" name="spoiler"><option value="all">All</option><option value="unknown">Unknown</option></select></label><label>Temporal certainty <select id="temporalFilter" name="temporal"><option value="all">All</option><option value="exact-authored-marker">Exact authored marker</option><option value="relative-authored-marker">Relative authored marker</option><option value="authored-duration">Authored duration</option><option value="unknown">Unknown</option></select></label><button id="resetFilters" type="button">Reset filters</button></fieldset><p id="chronologyStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form>
<ol id="events" class="chronology-events">{% for event in events %}<li id="event-{{ event.event_id|e }}" class="chronology-event" data-visibility="{{ event.visibility|e }}" data-canon="{{ event.canon_status|e }}" data-spoiler="{{ event.spoiler_level|e }}" data-temporal="{{ event.temporal.certainty|e }}" tabindex="-1"><article><header><p class="event-id">{{ event.event_id|e }}</p><h2>{{ event.label|e }}</h2><a class="event-link" href="#event-{{ event.event_id|e }}">Stable event link</a></header><dl><div><dt>Exact authored marker</dt><dd>{{ event.temporal.exact_authored_marker or 'Unknown' }}</dd></div><div><dt>Relative marker</dt><dd>{{ event.temporal.relative_marker or 'Unknown' }}</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>{% if event.temporal.duration %}{{ event.temporal.duration.authored_text|e }}{% else %}Unknown{% endif %}</dd></div><div><dt>Temporal certainty</dt><dd>{{ event.temporal.certainty|e }}</dd></div><div><dt>Visibility</dt><dd>{{ event.visibility|e }}</dd></div><div><dt>Canon status</dt><dd>{{ event.canon_status|e }}</dd></div><div><dt>Spoiler level</dt><dd>{{ event.spoiler_level|e }}</dd></div></dl><p class="source">Source heading: {{ event.source.heading|e }}. <a href="{{ event.source.canonical_url|e }}">Canonical source record</a> · <a href="{{ event.source.legacy_url|e }}">Complete Compendium anchor</a></p></article></li>{% endfor %}</ol>
</main><script src="chronology.js"></script></body></html>
